    "description": "1550 nm single-frequency Discrete-Mode (DM) narrow-linewidth telecom laser (DFB-like performance), available across the 1540-1560 nm range, in a 14-pin butterfly package with an integrated thermoelectric cooler (TEC), NTC thermistor, back-facet monitor photodiode, and optical isolator, terminated in an FC/APC single-mode fiber pigtail. Targeted at SONET/SDH and Gigabit Ethernet coherent/advanced-communications links. Class 3R laser product (IEC 60825-1).",
    "package": "14-pin butterfly (Pinout 01), FC/APC single-mode fiber pigtail",
    "pinCount": 14,
    "lifecycle": "active",
    "temperatureGrade": "-20..65",
